e consideration of these two case-studies shows the discrepancy of approaches and lack of the definition of sin among ascetics.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
